  "title": "Cryoport Systems Officially Opens New Global Supply Chain Center in Santa Ana, California",
  "summary": "Cryoport Systems, a global leader in temperature-controlled supply chain solutions for the life sciences industry, today announced the official opening of its new Global Supply Chain Center (GSCC) in Santa Ana, California. The 86,500-square-foot facility strengthens global logistics infrastructure and establishes a foundation for future growth.",
